## Mermaid diagrams

Flowcharts, sequence diagrams, and ER charts use `theme: base`, `securityLevel: strict`, and the generated teal token bag.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B{Is it working?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Great!]
    B -->|No| D[Debug]
    D --> B
    C --> E[End]
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API
    participant Database

    User->>API: Request data
    API->>Database: Query
    Database-->>API: Results
    API-->>User: Response
```

```mermaid
erDiagram
    USER ||--o{ ORDER : places
    ORDER ||--|{ LINE_ITEM : contains
    PRODUCT ||--o{ LINE_ITEM : "ordered in"
```
